TIM-on-Rust is a Rust re-implementation of the Token Identity Manager
originally developed at the Information System Authority of Estonia
(Riigi Infosüsteemi Amet, RIA) as the TARA Integration Module, and later
extended as a universal, provider-agnostic identity manager in Java by
Rainer Türner at https://github.com/buerokratt/TIM.
